0..76 Comment "// A recursive path whose endpoint calls a definition under a constructor of"
77..148 Comment "// a presented type: the kernel reads the endpoint by the type\'s rules,"
149..226 Comment "// which may rewrite the constructor away to the call beneath it, and reads a"
227..301 Comment "// transport the recursive path leaves standing as a neutral on that path."
302..373 Comment "// The integers and their sum follow cubical Agda\'s `Cubical/Data/Int`."
